Once you have the amulet, you want to bust out as quick as possible.
Dont worry about fighting stuff unless you have to.  use ?oTele on tele
allowed levels to get out quicker.
/oTele are useful on the planes.  You cant teleport, but you can
teleport other monsters.  Its easier to teleport things out of your way
than to kill them yourself.

One strategy, especially on the Astral plane, is to Haste self while
wearing jumping boot, and to jump along while teleing things out of
your way.  A substrategy is to use the jump spell (that you have) while
wearing speed boots.  You may run out of Pw though so be careful.

=oConflict is sooooo useful when performing the run.  Think about it,
would you rather be in an everyone against you battle, or everyone for
themselves.



